# 抽屉组件UI开发规范

## 概述

本规范基于异常稽核模块的抽屉组件设计，定义了抽屉类UI组件的标准布局、样式和交互模式。


## 抽屉组件基础配置

### 1. 抽屉容器配置

```vue
<el-drawer
  :visible.sync="drawer"
  direction="rtl"
  size="68%"
  :show-close="false"
  :wrapperClosable="false">
  <template #title>
    <div class="header-title">{{ title }}</div>
  </template>
</el-drawer>
```

**配置说明：**
- `direction="rtl"`：从右侧滑出
- `size="68%"`：标准宽度为68%
- `show-close="false"`：隐藏默认关闭按钮
- `wrapperClosable="false"`：禁止点击遮罩关闭

### 2. 标题样式规范

```scss
.header-title {
  color: #374151;
  font-size: 16px;
  font-weight: bold;
  padding-bottom: 16px;
  border-bottom: 2px solid #F8FAFE;
}
```

## 抽屉内容布局结构

### 1. 整体容器布局

```vue
<div class="drawer-container">
  <div class="information-body">
    <!-- 信息展示区域 -->
  </div>
  <div class="audit-confirm">
    <!-- 操作确认区域 -->
  </div>
</div>
```

```scss
.drawer-container {
  display: flex;
  padding: 0 10px 0 20px;
  flex-direction: column;
  background-color: #fff;
  height: calc(100vh - 54px);
}
```

### 2. 信息展示区域

```scss
.information-body {
  max-height: calc(100% - 368px);
  overflow-y: auto;

  // 自定义滚动条样式
  &::-webkit-scrollbar {
    width: 4px;
    background-color: #F8FAFE;
  }
  &::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {
    background-color: #E5E9F2;
    border-radius: 6px;
  }
}
```

### 3. 主标题样式

```scss
.body-title {
  font-size: 20px;
  font-weight: 500;
  color: #4B5563;
  margin-top: 20px;
}
```

## 双栏布局规范

### 1. 左右分栏结构

```vue
<div class="body-content">
  <div class="left-section">
    <!-- 左侧信息区域 -->
  </div>
  <div class="right-section">
    <!-- 右侧内容区域 -->
  </div>
</div>
```

```scss
.body-content {
  display: flex;

  .left-section {
    width: 45%;
  }

  .right-section {
    width: 55%;
  }
}
```

### 2. 信息项展示规范

```vue
<div class="info-section">
  <div class="section-title">{{ sectionName }}</div>
  <div class="info-item">
    <span class="left-label">{{ label }}</span>
    <span class="right-value">{{ value }}</span>
  </div>
</div>
```

```scss
.info-section {
  margin-bottom: 20px;

  .info-item {
    display: flex;
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 22px;
    align-items: left;
    margin-bottom: 12px;

    .left-label {
      width: 80px;
      color: #6B7280;
      margin-right: 12px;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    .right-value {
      color: #374151;
      margin-right: 8px;
      word-break: break-all;
    }
  }
}
```

## 区块标题规范

### 1. 标准区块标题

```vue
<div class="section-title">
  {{ title }}
  <span class="link-text" @click="handleAction">{{ linkText }}</span>
</div>
```

```scss
.section-title {
  font-size: 16px;
  font-weight: 600;
  color: #4B5563;
  margin: 20px 0 16px;
  padding-left: 10px;
  line-height: 22px;
  border-left: 2px solid #416FFC;
}

.link-text {
  font-size: 14px;
  color: #0071F3;
  margin-left: 12px;
  font-weight: 400;
  cursor: pointer;

  &:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
}
```

## 图片展示组件规范

### 1. 图片网格布局

```vue
<div class="photo-body">
  <div class="photo-item" v-for="(photo, index) in photos" :key="index">
    <div class="photo-placeholder" :class="{ auto: photo.autoSize }">
      <viewer v-if="photo.src">
        <img class="photo-img" :src="photo.src" alt="">
      </viewer>
      <div v-else class="no-image">暂无图片</div>
    </div>
    <div class="photo-label">{{ photo.label }}</div>
  </div>
</div>
```

```scss
.photo-body {
  display: flex;
  gap: 16px;
  margin-bottom: 20px;

  .photo-item {
    text-align: center;
    width: calc((100% - 54px) / 4);

    .photo-placeholder {
      width: 100%;
      background: #f0f0f0;
      height: calc(100% - 26px);

      .photo-img {
        width: 100%;
        aspect-ratio: 1;
        object-fit: fill;
      }

      .no-image {
        font-size: 14px;
        color: #4B5563;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        aspect-ratio: 1;
      }

      &.auto {
        margin-right: 6px;
      }
    }

    .photo-label {
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #4B5563;
      line-height: 22px;
      margin-top: 4px;
    }
  }
}
```

## 状态标签规范

### 1. 相似度显示

```vue
<span class="similarity" :class="similarity > 80 ? 'high' : 'low'">
  {{ similarity }}%
</span>
```

```scss
.similarity {
  font-size: 14px;
  font-weight: bold;
  margin-left: 16px;
}

.high { color: #10B981; }
.low { color: #EF4444; }
```

### 2. 异常程度标签

```vue
<span class="tag-value" :class="degreeColorEnum[degree]">
  {{ degreeText }}
</span>
```

```scss
.tag-value {
  padding: 0 6px;
  font-size: 14px;
  line-height: 22px;
  border-radius: 4px;
}

.normal {
  color: #10B981;
  background: #E8F8F3;
}

.warning {
  color: #F59E0B;
  background: #FEF6D5;
}

.serious {
  color: #EF4444;
  background: #FEEDED;
}
```

## 底部操作区域规范

### 1. 单栏操作区域

```vue
<div class="audit-confirm">
  <div class="confirm-result">
    <!-- 结果展示区域 -->
  </div>
  <div class="audit-form">
    <!-- 表单区域 -->
  </div>
  <div class="body-sender">
    <!-- 按钮区域 -->
  </div>
</div>
```

```scss
.audit-confirm {
  width: calc(100% + 30px);
  min-height: 368px;
  flex: 1;
  margin: 0 -10px 0 -20px;
  background: #FFFFFF;
  box-shadow: 0px -2px 12px 0px rgba(0,0,0,0.16);

  .audit-form {
    padding: 20px 20px 0;
  }

  .body-sender {
    margin: 0 0 20px 102px;
  }
}
```

### 2. 双栏操作区域（复核模式）

```vue
<div class="confirm-result">
  <div class="result-left">
    <!-- 左侧稽核结果 -->
  </div>
  <div class="result-right">
    <!-- 右侧复核表单 -->
    <div class="body-sender">
      <!-- 按钮区域 -->
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
```

```scss
.confirm-result {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  padding: 0 20px;

  .result-left {
    width: 45%;
  }

  .result-right {
    width: 55%;

    .body-sender {
      margin: 0 0 20px 82px;
    }
  }
}
```

## 结果展示组件规范

### 1. 带图标的结果展示

```vue
<div class="confirm-result">
  <i class="icon" :class="result === '正常' ? 'el-icon-success' : 'el-icon-error'" />
  <span class="result-title">比对结果:
    <span :class="result === '正常' ? 'high' : 'low'">
      {{ result }}
    </span>
  </span>
  <span class="sub-result">{{ detailText }}</span>
</div>
```

```scss
.confirm-result {
  height: 54px;
  border-radius: 6px;
  line-height: 54px;
  font-size: 14px;
  color: #4B5563;
  justify-content: flex-start;
  background-color: #F0F4FD;
  margin: 12px 20px 0;
  width: calc(100% - 80px);

  .result-title {
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: bold;
    color: #4B5563;
  }

  .sub-result {
    margin-left: 20px;
  }
}

.el-icon-success {
  margin: 0 10px 0 16px;
  color: rgb(19, 182, 19);
  font-size: 20px;
}

.el-icon-error {
  margin: 0 16px;
  color: red;
  font-size: 20px;
}
```

